            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.59</title></head><body><h1>Quieter when your Mac is locked</h1><ul><li>If Cove needs your AI key while your Mac is locked (or Touch ID can't be shown because Cove is in the background), it no longer interrupts you with an alert. The status line says AI is paused, and the work picks up again on the next sync.</li></ul><p>Nothing is sent without you.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
