            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.58</title></head><body><h1>Send from the right address</h1><ul><li>Choose a default From address when your Gmail can send from more than one.</li><li>Replies come from the address the email was sent to, and the reply box shows which one, with a menu to change it.</li><li>Settings → Gmail is redesigned: your account, sending, sync and Google services (Calendar and Tasks) in clear cards.</li></ul><p>Nothing is sent without you.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
