        <item>
            <title>0.1.57</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:57:45 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://covemail.xyz/beta/</link>
            <sparkle:version>59</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.57</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.57</title></head><body><h1>Mail from the keyboard</h1><ul><li>R replies to the open email, E marks it done (archives it and opens the next one), and U marks it read or unread.</li><li>⌘Delete still moves it to Trash with Undo, and ↑ ↓ and Esc move around.</li><li>Shortcuts pause while you type, and the list footer shows them.</li></ul><p>Nothing is sent, archived or deleted without you.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
